        rdfs:comment                   "velvet, 1500s, Italian"@en , "Very dark purplish-black velvet, two lengths seamed down the centre to create a pattern match, very large ogival lattice with main ogee containing flowers and stylized leaves, separating wide lattice filled in with planes containing floral and leaf designs and geometric patterns."@en ;
